// Apnar digital — LIVE-READY PREPARATION server (NOT published).
// Prepared for live at the user's request, but not deployed or shared.
// Live password rule: 8 characters, mixed numbers + letters + # @ * $.
// Real email still requires SMTP env vars; see README live-ready section.
// No credentials are hardcoded here. Admin is created via the first-run
// setup form in the browser (/admin/setup); only a salted scrypt hash
// is stored. Visitor passwords are generated by the server, hashed, and
// (in demo mode) written to data/outbox.json — never returned to a page.
// Real email is sent ONLY if SMTP env vars are set; otherwise demo mode.
